ountRate":"1","currencyPrice":0.0116,"currencySymbol":"$","isForeignDiscount":null,"ladderLevel":null}],"productImages":["https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20180914_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A106KP8NNNC_C19702_front_10.jpg","https://assets.lcsc.com/images/lcsc/900x900/20180914_Samsung-Electro-Mechanics-CL10A106KP8NNNC_C19702_back_10.jpg"],"edaSvgInfo":{"schSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/3d033fcb6d334c25b65a754834cf5aaf.svg?t=1744296931","pcbSvg":"//image.easyeda.com/component_svgs/prod/f8151fdc728a41ebbc304e11d39e5437.svg?t=1744296931"},"faqs":[{"question":"What Are the Key Electrical Parameters of the CL10A106KP8NNNC, and Is 10V Sufficient for Typical 3.3V and 5V Decoupling Applications?","answer":"The CL10A106KP8NNNC is a 10uF ceramic capacitor rated at 10V with an X5R dielectric in a 0603 package. For a 3.3V power rail, the 10V rating provides a comfortable safety margin of approximately 3x. For a 5V rail, the margin is 2x, which is generally acceptable for most digital systems. However, designers should account for DC bias derating: at 5V, the effective capacitance of an X5R-dielectric part may reduce significantly. Verify actual capacitance under DC bias conditions before finalizing the design for 5V applications."},{"question":"What does the X5R dielectric classification mean for the CL10A106KP8NNNC, and over what temperature range is its capacitance guaranteed?","answer":"The X5R designation follows the EIA standard: X = lower temperature limit of -55°C, 5 = upper limit of +85°C, and R = capacitance change within ±15% across that range. This makes the CL10A106KP8NNNC suitable for general-purpose decoupling, bulk energy storage, and power filtering from -55°C to +85°C. X5R offers better capacitance stability than Y5V but lower stability than C0G/NP0. It is not recommended for precision timing or resonant circuits where tight capacitance tolerance is required over the full operating temperature range."},{"question":"Is the CL10A106KP8NNNC a Drop-in Replacement for Other 10uF 10V X5R 0603 Ceramic Capacitors From Murata or TDK?","answer":"Yes. The CL10A106KP8NNNC uses the standard 0603 (1608 Metric) footprint, which is fully interchangeable with IPC-7351-compliant land patterns used across Murata (GRM188R61A106KE69), TDK (C1608X5R1A106K), and Kemet (C0603C106K8RACTU) equivalents. The ±10% tolerance (K-grade) and X5R dielectric classification are standard across the industry. Always cross-check the rated voltage (10V) and DC bias derating curves in the datasheet before substitution, as performance under bias can vary between manufacturers even with identical nominal specs."},{"question":"What Are the Recommended Reflow Soldering Conditions for the CL10A106KP8NNNC, and Does Its 0603 Ceramic Body Require Special Handling?","answer":"The CL10A106KP8NNNC is fully RoHS compliant and rated for Pb-free reflow soldering. The recommended peak reflow temperature is 260°C for up to 10 seconds at the solder joint. The 0603 ceramic body is susceptible to cracking from rapid thermal shock or excessive mechanical stress during board flexure. Ensure a controlled heating and cooling ramp rate per IPC/JEDEC J-STD-020 for class MSL 1 components. Standard packaging is 4,000 pieces per full reel, and a minimum purchase of 50 pieces applies for prototype orders. Avoid ultrasonic cleaning processes after assembly."},{"question":"What Are the Pricing Tiers and Stock Availability for the CL10A106KP8NNNC for Production Volumes?","answer":"LCSC lists the CL10A106KP8NNNC with a minimum order quantity of 50 pieces and standard reel packaging of 4,000 pieces. Volume pricing is: 50+ pcs at $0.0065, 500+ at $0.0051, 1,500+ at $0.0045, 4,000+ at $0.0040, 24,000+ at $0.0038, and 48,000+ at $0.0037 per piece. With over 9,287,750 units available for immediate shipment, supply continuity is not a concern for most production runs. Samsung Electro-Mechanics is a Tier-1 manufacturer, making this part an excellent choice for cost-sensitive IoT and consumer electronics BOM optimization."}],"pdfUrl":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/02336ea48ea44ca18c72517dd3cb7b47.pdf?productCode=C19702","authenticationList":["ROHS3 认证"],"isRohsCert":true,"rohsCertType":"ROHS3","rohsCertList":[{"fileCode":"wj1864931","fileName":" 贴片电容(MLCC)_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe72c154ab3703f908ae5b1ac157c1ec.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1624669","fileName":"ROHS认证_贴片电容原材料_SAMSUNG(三星).zip","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/329ecc8904689d9af5b272ec0ed8e00a.zip"},{"fileCode":"wj1750838","fileName":"全量通用_ROHS认证_SAMSUNG(三星半导体).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/fe7ad62d96832adf9770d718059cff38.pdf"},{"fileCode":"wj1478399","fileName":"MLCCCL系列_ROHS认证(英文版)_SAMSUNG(三星).pdf","url":"https://datasheet.lcsc.com/certification/rohs/5b97a5d84519001adb216d4c9e6919ce.pdf"}],"productDescEn":"10uF ±10% 10V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","productIntroEn":"10uF ±10% 10V Ceramic Capacitor X5R 0603","paramVOList":[{"paramCode":"param_10951_n","paramName":"容值","paramNameEn":"Capacitance","paramValue":"10uF","paramValueEn":"10uF","paramValueEnForSearch":1.0E7,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":1},{"paramCode":"param_10927","paramName":"温度系数","paramNameEn":"Temperature Coefficient","paramValue":"X5R","paramValueEn":"X5R","paramValueEnForSearch":-1.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":4},{"paramCode":"param_10923_s","paramName":"精度","paramNameEn":"Tolerance","paramValue":"±10%","paramValueEn":"±10%","paramValueEnForSearch":null,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":2},{"paramCode":"param_10924_n","paramName":"额定电压","paramNameEn":"Voltage Rating","paramValue":"10V","paramValueEn":"10V","paramValueEnForSearch":10.0,"isMain":true,"sortNumber":1,"sort":3}],"wmCatalogId":1142,"wmCatalogNameEn":"Ceramic Capacitors","productArrange":"Tape & Reel (TR)","productWeight":0.000032000,"foreignWeight":0.000032000,"isForeignOnsale":true,"isForeignDisplay":true,"isNotOverstock"